<title>SINGAPORE: RESEARCH ALERT-DBS cuts Hitachi Zosen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-DBS cuts Hitachi Zosen.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>DBS Investment Research said on Tuesday it had cut its recommendation on ship-repair company Hitachi Zosen to &quot;reduce&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; on expectations that Hitachi would underperform the ship-repair sector.</p>
</text>
